WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.411
AED owner follow-up.

00:00:01.411 --> 00:00:04.093
Notify the facility or safety manager.

00:00:04.093 --> 00:00:14.536
The owner or vendor replaces used consumables, checks the battery, repairs the cabinet where needed and can retrieve the AED event record for audit.
